{"publicId":"6662f0a1-5eff-4308-89d6-6ec077690c3a","title":"硬件钱包保护机制与交易安全局限性分析","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T14:16:30.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T14:16:30.000Z","digest":"The Defiant于2026年11月17日澄清：硬件钱包通过物理隔离保护签名密钥（而非存储的币），但密钥隔离无法确保支付验证或智能合约的安全性【新】。硬件钱包设计初衷是防密钥泄露，但实际场景中攻击者可能通过其他途径绕过隔离机制，例如篡改交易前数据或利用合约漏洞。该结论基于硬件钱包工作原理——签名密钥仅用于交易时生成签名，存储介质与网络通信模块物理分离，但无法阻止网络层或应用层的攻击。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T15:36:18.531Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"什么是硬件钱包，它保护什么？","latestReport":{"id":"m814zykflr82vfevuh4q4jh64"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fasfNs5WlT04","title":"介绍硬件钱包及其保护内容","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T14:16:30.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"m814zykflr82vfevuh4q4jh64","title":"什么是硬件钱包，它保护什么？","summary":"硬件钱包保护签名密钥，而非存储其中的币。支付显示即使密钥隔离，也不能保证交易安全或合约安全。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T14:16:30.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"m814zykflr82vfevuh4q4jh64","title":"什么是硬件钱包，它保护什么？","summary":"硬件钱包保护签名密钥，而非存储其中的币。支付显示即使密钥隔离，也不能保证交易安全或合约安全。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T14:16:30.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[]}